In other news, yesterday my samurai character died on the astral plane
=96 that's a first for me. I've never died on the astral plane before,
and I take it as a sign that my changes are working. :p (ie. the late
game is more difficult). I was somewhat under-prepared when I got
there. I think the main problem was that I didn't have conflict, or
